# The etcd the image carries (ADR 0012): the server, built from source at the commit that release
# v3.6.16 of the public repository is. The commit, not the tag, is the pin: build.sh fetches that
# object and fails unless HEAD is it, and a tag can be moved. The release is the one gaon's
# apiserver module pins (apiserver/go.mod at the gaon commit image/gaon/pin.env names).
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that reruns `make image` and the two-Node gaon test
# (make test-qemu), when gaon moves the etcd release its API server is built against or an
# advisory is published for the pinned one. No bot proposes it.
ETCD_REPO=https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd
ETCD_VERSION=3.6.16
ETCD_COMMIT=0b065e61c679ea81f6862bb24c9815f7fc673966
